^ Layer1 |  **mtd0** \\ ''u-boot'' \\ 256 KiB  |  **mtd1** \\ ''u-boot-env'' \\ 64 KiB  |  **mtd2** \\ ''firmware'' \\ 7232 KiB <sub><sup>(= FlashSize-(256+64+640+64)) </sup></sub> ||| **mtd6** \\ ''certs'' 640 KiB | **mtd7** \\ ''art'' 64 KiB   |
^ Layer2 |:::|:::|  **mtd3** \\ ''kernel'' \\ about 1 MiB  |  **mtd4** \\ ''rootfs'' ||:::|:::|
^ Layer3 |:::|:::|:::                       |  **''/dev/root''** \\ around 2 MiB  |  **mtd5** \\ ''rootfs_data'' \\ around 4.5 MiB  |:::|:::|
